     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Dear group,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">I generated an occupancy prediction map of a species using Chandler´s <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/unmarked/vignettes/spp-dist.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/unmarked/vignettes/spp-dist.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449764715000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1pPvKzFYefzB--v1kmdhsH\">vignette</a>. However, I would like to overlay a shapefile with the borders of different reserves and crop (clip) these reserves to generate facets to see these patterns in more detail (i.e &quot;zoom in&quot;). </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Since the prediction map is not a raster but a &quot;trellis&quot; class (I used the function spplot), I can´t seem to find out how to retain the prediction map as a raster (as in the input file used at the beginning for that prediction map) or convert it to another class/type so I can combine it with the shapefile of the reserves. I tried a few things I found on internet, but I haven´t managed to adapt this to my situation.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">I would appreciate it if someone has experience with this and could point me in the right direction. If there is a document or another vignette I am missing it would be helpful to know too.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Thank you very much in advance,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Lain</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><br></div><div><div><p style=\"font-family:Tahoma;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:black\">Postdoctoral Research Fellow<span></span></span></i></p><p style=\"font-family:Tahoma;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:black\">Wildlife Ecology Lab,</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span></span></span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px\"><i>School of Natural Resource Management</i></span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:Tahoma;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:black\">Nelson Mandela University<span></span></span></i></p><p style=\"font-family:Tahoma;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">George Campus, </span></i><i><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">South Africa</span></i></p><p style=\"font-family:Tahoma;margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"font-family:Tahoma;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Mobile: <a href=\"tel:+27%2076%20259%209325\" value=\"+27762599325\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+27-0762599325</a><span></span></span></i></p><p style=\"font-family:Tahoma;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Lain....@Mandela.ac.za</a></span></i></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
